### 0.4.1 (2026-08-05)
- 安全加固：dfm.js doAction / editor.js 读写请求补齐 X-CSRF-Token（与官方 upload 协议对齐，纵深防御）
- 下载交互：单文件直链与官方一致；多选/目录下载给出明确提示
- 清理过期死代码（smoke_test.php / verify.py 引用已删除的 fs.php）

### 0.4.0 (2026-08-05)
- 规范修复：txz 属主 root:root、权限 755/644、CRLF→LF、SHA256 校验注入
- PLG 增加 min=7.0.0（依赖内置版）、icon 属性
- txz 发布路径修正：releases/download（此前 source/ 404）
- Renamed to AExplorer (independent page, no conflict with system Browse)
- Based on Unraid 7 built-in Dynamix File Manager (webGui kernel)
- UI rewritten: Windows 11 Explorer style (sidebar tree, breadcrumbs, virtual scroll)
- Reuses system Control.php protocol (mode:file JSON + task queue)
- CSRF token injection, ex_ prefixed functions, no nchan script conflict
</CHANGES>

<FILE Run="/bin/bash">
<INLINE>
rm -f $(ls /boot/config/plugins/&name;/&name;*.txz 2>/dev/null|grep -v '&version;')
</INLINE>
</FILE>

<FILE Name="/boot/config/plugins/&name;/&file;" Run="upgradepkg --install-new">
<URL>&releaseURL;/&file;</URL>
<SHA256>b8e697c374f1ea24bf78fc73fd43a9958ee7ea801b51688bfe234c35fd653fc0</SHA256>
</FILE>

<FILE Run="/bin/bash">
<INLINE>
echo ""
echo "----------------------------------------------------"
echo " &name; has been installed."
echo " Version: &version;"
echo ""
echo " Find it under Main -> AExplorer"
echo "----------------------------------------------------"
echo ""
</INLINE>
</FILE>

<FILE Run="/bin/bash" Method="remove">
<INLINE>
removepkg &name;-&version;
rm -r /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/&name;
rm -r /boot/config/plugins/&name;
</INLINE>
</FILE>

</PLUGIN>
